<title>ESTONIA: MICHAEL JACKSON TO GIVE CONCERT IN TALLINN.</title>
<headline>MICHAEL JACKSON TO GIVE CONCERT IN TALLINN.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pop star Michael Jackson is to give a concert in the Estonian capital on August 22 as part of a Scandinavian tour, news agency ETA said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said that ticket sales begin on April 31 and the price will intially be 390 kroons or $30.</p>
<p>After Tallinn, Jackson will travel to Helsinki.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400</p>
